; Original Blitz3D side of the dungeon benchmark: the timer has milliseconds only, and there are no draw counters (0).

Function BenchMicros()
	Return MilliSecs() * 1000
End Function

Function BenchDraws()
	Return 0
End Function

Function BenchPipelines()
	Return 0
End Function

Function BenchTextures()
	Return 0
End Function

Function BenchBuffers()
	Return 0
End Function

; The original has no SpriteDepthFade, so the flames and smoke stay as they are.
Function BenchDepthFade(sprite, distance#)
End Function

; The original crashes with more sprites than that: they share one vertex buffer, 4 vertices each.
Function BenchMaxSprites()
	Return 16383
End Function

; Shows the frame without waiting for the display (the original has no Flip 2).
Function BenchFlip()
	Flip 0
End Function
